  "decision_conditions": [
    "Class C3(b) only covers up to six people (adults) living together as a single household and receiving care. There are concerns regarding the intensification of use of the property, as there would be five residents and a minimum of two carers on site at any one time excluding and other visitors. Based on the information submitted with the application, the proposed use would not fall under Class C3(b) and therefore would give rise to a material change of use for which planning permission is required."
  ],
